From 48e866a6ac52a7225f1ad90f6d9a56dda5d87ec8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:22:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PS3: threaded GPU (lv2 thread backend), timing counters

- pcsxr-threads: lv2 PPU threads/mutexes/conds for PSL1GHT (rthreads has none)
- psl1ght: build with USE_ASYNC_GPU
- gpu_async: big-endian branch of gpu_async_sync_ecmds referenced an
  undeclared variable (never compiled on big-endian before)
- gpulib_set_thread_rendering(), and timebase counters for time spent in
  GPU calls and SPU sample generation

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HyAyv1PvGqyTegufofF5fp
